{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年45歲的男星余文樂，今年7月無預警宣布與台灣「皮帶大王」千金王棠云離婚，正式結束長達近9年的婚姻生活。</p><p>兩人離婚後關係依舊融洽，並達成共識以「家人」身份共同撫養兒子余初見（Cody）與女兒余初心（Celest）。</p><p>早前更曾捕獲到二人帶一對子</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:15:37.918182+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:01:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:08:55.082341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:08:55.082341+00:00","content_hash":"b2c61711ab42c114b8270b714c83e55326bf2f7e1225a0a213cad346e063e9b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}